WEBVTT

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.080
Welcome to our Velvet Room...

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.010
This is actually rather hard, isn't it?

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:24.720
Oh, my, you're here?

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:29.430
Hellos and goodbyes are always
two sides of the same coin.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:36.190
You seem to be enjoying what little time
you have left with your close friends.

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:42.950
The bonds that you've formed throughout
your journey are both powerful and precious.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:46.620
No matter how many
miles may separate you,

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.040
surely you will never lose them...

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:04.340
I'm thinking of snowboarding.
How about you, Naoto-kun?

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:07.720
Actually, I've never
skied before in my life.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.810
Really? That's kind of unexpected.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.980
You'll be just fine, Naoto-kun.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.730
Because Kanji will show
the ropes, from A to Z!

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:18.150
What the...? H-Hey, what's up with that?

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:20.190
Well, I guess it's okay.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.820
Thanks, Tatsumi-kun!

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:26.490
From first base to second
base to home plate?

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:28.280
Why are you so spaced out?

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:27.990
You're a pervert, Kanji!

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.990
It's your mind that's
perverted, damn you!

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:30.990
It's a video, so move around! Move around!

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.790
Hey, that looks like the real deal!

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.460
Did you buy it for this trip?

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:38.840
Nah, it's a display model
or something from Junes.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.550
It was lying around
the house, so I brought it.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.340
Won't you get in trouble with your dad?

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.050
It's cool, it's cool.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:48.470
I mean, we want something
to remember this trip by, right?

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:51.430
Oh, right... That's true, isn't it?

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:55.440
Come spring, Narukami-senpai
will be moving back to the city.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:00.900
So this trip will be Senpai's last
memories of his time in Inaba, huh?

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.740
What's with all these gloomy faces?

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.580
It's not like we're never
gonna see him again.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.080
Right, Narukami-kun?

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.620
Right, of course!

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:20.250
No matter what! No matter what,
let's hang out again, Sensei!

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.670
Promise us!

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.630
Come back anytime, all right?

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:24.380
Yeah.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.800
Hey, is it coming into view?

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.470
Ah! So that's it?

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:30.550
It's quite high, isn't it?

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.140
You'll figure it out! You will!

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.500
Yay!

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.880
Hanamura, you're not too shabby!

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.960
Neither are you! Are you sure
you've never snowboarded before?

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.670
Well, it's the same as skiing, right?

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.060
I said, spread your feet in a V!

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.970
If you're timid, it'll be
more dangerous for you!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:42.600
V-V position, V position...

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.360
Ouch!

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:52.990
Huh?

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.120
Oh, I-I'm sorry!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.540
Huh?

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.160
Wh-Whoa!

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.120
S-Sorry!

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.500
Don't worry about it.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.260
T-Tatsumi-kun? Blood! Blood!

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.930
Senpai!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:21.770
Wait up!

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.910
Seriously!

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.160
Come on, Senpai, you're way too fast!

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:43.910
Oh, sorry.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.500
But you're so cool!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:50.060
Woo hoo!

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.590
If I win, you gotta go on a date with me!

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:53.760
I won't let you!

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:54.050
What?

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.050
Both of them are so fast!

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:57.390
Yes, they are.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:00.680
You're not gonna overtake me just like that!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:02.220
Huh? Wait...

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:05.980
Teddie! Stop!

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:06.640
Huh?

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:07.230
Whoa!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.230
Whoa! Whoa!

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:13.530
Whoa!

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:20.120
Whoa!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.120
Huh?

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.170
Oops, oops!

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.050
Well, why not get this on video?

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.100
I-I thought I was gonna die.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.060
Hey, hey! How would you
grade my jump just now?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.150
Zero! Zero!

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:52.020
Just look! You're covered in snow.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:56.320
I mean, aren't you cold?
You're not even wearing ski gear!

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.030
I'm always toasty warm!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:02.120
I see, so it's a cold-proof costume...

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.540
I'd like to know what it's made of.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.830
Half of me is made of gentleness!

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:11.210
Then... What the hell is
the other half made of?

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:12.920
Bear fur, that's what!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.960
Gentleness and... fur?

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:22.100
Gentleness and fur... gentle-fur?

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.760
Hey!

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.650
Ahhhh!

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.440
Taking a bath is like
cleansing your life, huh?

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:39.110
This is the second time we've
all soaked in a huge bath like this.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.240
The first time was at Amagi's place...

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.830
W-Well, we sure goofed off a lot last year!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:52.080
Considering how busy
we were with those incidents.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:58.010
I never knew the outside world was
so much fun until I met Sensei and you guys!

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:01.510
So much happened last year, didn't it?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.640
The pick-up contest in Okina.

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:08.810
Now that was totally brutal.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.810
I want to go to the beach again!

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.810
Yeah, to see the swimsuits, right?

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.520
I like yukata robes, too!

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.280
Nana-chan was so cute during the fireworks!

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:23.990
Those sparklers are short-lived, but
that's why they pierce your heart so, right?

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:28.290
You biker gang types have
a poetic side, too, I see.

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:32.420
Right, right, that band totally saved my butt!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:35.920
That was an ordeal, Rise-chan not
being able to get to the stage.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:36.630
Huh?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:37.800
What's wrong?

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:42.630
That concert... how did we
get through it while Rise wasn't there?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.720
Um...

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:46.300
Well... Huh? What did we do?

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:50.140
What's up with that groaning?

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.190
I can't remember...

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:57.480
Yosuke, that day... Who did
we buy that sexy swimsuit for?

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:02.780
For the beach, you mean?
That day we... Huh? Who was it for?

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.830
Wasn't it for Amagi Senpai or someone?

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:09.290
No! It was a really sexy type of swimsuit
that wouldn't look good on Chie-chan and the others!

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:12.210
You're being unintentionally rude, you know.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:18.040
Oh, man! It's no good! I can't remember!

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:21.260
And we're not even old farts yet...

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.470
Who are you calling an old fart?

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:25.300
I-I wasn't talking about you!

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.510
Hey, you're right.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:30.430
Sorry.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.310
You know what, I thought too hard
and now I've soaked too long.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.940
Why don't we head out now?

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.440
All righty!

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:46.700
Now that our bodies are clean,
let's take up the challenge!

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:50.490
Huh? Who are you gonna challenge?

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:55.960
Well, you see, I saw a group of fine
young college girls in the cafeteria!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.420
Don't tell me you're gonna hit on them!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.420
Wanna come with, Yosuke?

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:00.590
Not on your life!

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:14.930
Uh, right now, we just got out of
the bath and we're chilling.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.400
All you have to do is give in to the speed.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.940
I-I can't!

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:21.690
Nobody will care!

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:23.990
Hey, what are you looking at?

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:24.320
Hmm?

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.030
The cell phone pictures I took today.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.660
Hey, looking good!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.290
Yu-senpai was soooo awesome!

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:35.710
Try snowboarding tomorrow!
It's such a blast!

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:36.870
Sounds good.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.000
I have some more pictures!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.590
Hey, that's the last one.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.010
Want to see the ones from before?

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:46.090
Show us! Show us!

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.390
This is from the day our band performed.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:51.220
Hey, that brings back memories!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:53.970
This photo...

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:55.930
What's wrong, Senpai?

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:59.770
Isn't there something off about it?

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.440
Hey, you're right.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.860
See? Right here...
why is there such a big space?

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:10.120
That's true. It's like somebody was there.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:13.370
Somebody... was there?

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.370
Same for this one.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.000
This one's weird, too!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:23.290
But why? I just took them like normal!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.920
Don't tell me they're ghost photos?

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:27.920
What?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.180
Show me! Show me!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.930
Why do you look so thrilled?

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:41.650
Yeah... I admit it is kind of weird,
but isn't it just a coincidence?

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:45.820
But they're all like that - don't you
think that's just too weird?

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.820
You think it's a ghost?
The work of a ghost, maybe?

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:52.570
Ph-Photos of this quality...
it would be child's play to doctor them.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.990
I would never do such a thing!

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:57.370
Then are these... seriously?

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:04.340
Listen, I heard that they sometimes
unearth clay figurines in these mountains.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:08.550
Maybe years ago, this whole
place used to be a cemetery!

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.130
Wh-Wh-Wh-Why would you
mention that now?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:14.850
Stop it! There is something
about the mountains! Seriously!

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.970
I don't need that kind of
experience unless it's a shoot!

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:18.600
Really...

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.440
Why are you looking so serious?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.780
O-O-Oral traditions are merely cultural
products with a strong storytelling component,

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:27.680
and as such they are not backed up by science,

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.740
and if this place is an ancient burial ground,

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.200
it would be the same as
a shrine, s-so in other words...

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.410
Naoto-kun, are you afraid of
ghosts, by any chance?

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.080
Huh? Uh...um...

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:39.750
Yes.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.580
[Smitten!]

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:46.880
Oh, please, I totally can't take this!
Let's talk about something more fun!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:50.720
Hey! All right, then, let's
watch the video I shot today!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:54.390
Huh?

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:55.930
What's wrong?

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:57.390
Well...

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:00.270
There's something here
besides today's footage...

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:09.940
<i>That's a display model,
by the way, so handle it with care!</i>

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:08.780
Hey, this is...

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.610
Wow! That brings back memories!

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:14.410
Come to think of it, we did
shoot this video, didn't we?

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:19.870
<i>Whaaat? D-Don't think about it!
You gotta feel it! Just kidding!</i>

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.740
Um... May I ask a question?

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:21.200
This video...who's the one taking it?

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:25.130
Huh? Narukami-kun... Wasn't it you?

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:28.170
<i>You better believe it is! Here,
a special bonus for a beefsteak lover!</i>

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:28.040
No, it wasn't me.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.380
We're all in this video, aren't we?

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:36.220
Hey, hey, then seriously,
who was shooting this, then?

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:42.980
D-Don't tell me... for real...?

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.110
B-B-Blackout!

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:51.780
I mean, something just passed by!
Right now... something... here!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.960
Oh, please! The lights!
The lights - turn them on!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.620
Just chill, will you? Uh...where's the switch?

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:09.340
You peeked, didn't you?

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:13.840
Feasting on snacks when
I'm not here... I'm gonna curse you!

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:17.930
Shall we take him out?

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:19.760
Yes, let's kill him.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:23.770
Sorry, Teddie. There's only us here.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.850
No witnesses, and this will
go straight to Cold Cases.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.400
You sure about this, Detective?

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:34.780
Hey, my sweet babies...
The light's gone out of your eyes...

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.320
Whoa!

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:39.530
Jeez, he scared us all for nothing!

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:42.040
<i>Hey, um...</i>

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:48.380
<i>Huh? You trying to get me to bare my soul again?</i>

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.370
Yu?

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.380
There was someone.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:49.710
Huh?

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.630
Aside from us, there was someone else.

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.220
Someone?

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:04.720
S-Someone who?

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.350
I don't know.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:11.650
Senpai, we've had enough ghost stories!

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.690
No. There really was someone.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.990
It's just that we've forgotten about that person.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:23.280
You're not joking about this, are you?

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.500
Someone else besides us...

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.580
Do you remember something?

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:33.420
Oh, no, it's not like I remember,

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.460
but there's something that's been bugging me.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.470
When I was looking for my ski wear...

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:43.430
I found some clothes in my
bureau - really adorable clothes!

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:46.310
But I can't remember anything.

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:50.980
I know these are clothes that
someone picked out for me...

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:55.570
So when I asked Yukiko, she told me
that she has clothes like that, too.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:57.990
Yes, but it's strange.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.860
For some reason, I can't remember
anything about the day I bought them.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.120
Are you serious?

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.740
What is this? What's going on?

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.240
If, just as Narukami-senpai says,

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:10.830
there was someone else besides us,
this would all add up.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:14.090
It's too bizarre to be called speculation, but...

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:21.090
Do you want to remember, Sensei?

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.390
Just like it was for me,

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:31.770
the memories you've forgotten might turn out
to be painful or sad if you do remember them.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.320
Even so...

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.030
I want to find out the truth.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.110
Sensei...

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:49.450
Very well. Everyone, regarding this case,

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.920
shall we investigate anew
after we've returned home?

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.710
Good idea. There's no way
to investigate here, anyway.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:17:00.220
And we want Narukami-kun
to enjoy this trip as much as he can!

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.050
Thanks.

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:15.610
Come on, I told you
to open up your heels more.

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:18.610
I-If I fall, will you catch me?

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:23.700
Don't you dare fall! Don't you
dare fall, no matter what!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:28.700
Hey, don't just coach Naoto-kun
all day! Coach me, too!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:31.290
But you can already ski without any coaching!

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:36.000
Well, if I'm going to get coached,
I'd totally rather have Yu-senpai!

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.420
Then why don't you go over to Senpai?

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:41.210
Because I'm too scared to ski down
the Intermediate Course.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.430
Whoa... Wow!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.600
Hey, are you spooked?

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:57.400
Like hell I am! Don't get
too dazzled by my skiing, now!

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:07.030
Don't give me that!
Let's get this show on the road!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.740
All right, here goes!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:54.080
It's like the TV world...

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:12.220
Are you...?

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.070
Are you...?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.380
Are you...?

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:46.980
Marie!

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.430
Yu! Yu!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.390
Narukami-kun!

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:20.310
Senpai!

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:24.190
Hey, he's awake!

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.270
Thank goodness...

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:29.820
You guys, why are you here?

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:32.990
Why are we here?
Of course we came after you!

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:37.620
Since you moved from where you fell,
we had a hard time finding you.

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:42.830
Really, now! We were soooo worried!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.290
Huh? Sensei? What's the matter?

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:47.920
Don't tell me you're injured somewhere...

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:53.550
You guys, the snowstorm...
Were you all right?

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.890
Snowstorm? What are you talking about?

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:06.560
That's...

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:09.440
Marie-chan's comb, right?

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:20.240
Yeah!

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:25.790
Huh?

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:05.100
Shut up! Shut your mouth, moron!

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:06.980
Don't just vanish on your own, moron!

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:08.140
What's up with that, moron?

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:09.390
You're the moron!

00:24:09.390 --> 00:24:10.810
Full of all that stupid, pompous talk!

00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:12.020
Don't call me a moron!

00:24:12.020 --> 00:24:14.070
You're saying it yourself, moron!
